[{:db/id "q-43308/selection/75692e2af5f10c8a5a9cd964ba7987d08d791913525c7c2f6c47e226c666ec46" :answer/id #uuid "f5c7796b-60d1-5445-8c80-e7494e342810" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-43308/selection/600a97bfe5c0f5f450e278dad500ed1bd1542ae6fbac5348b9d39cec0165c3d5" :answer/id #uuid "3bee3c4e-865e-5489-aa24-85733da68299" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-43308/selection/45ba5db4c4017ee3a1bce229a169f875d8313fcbc76b4d72f60083f66b0ba711" :answer/id #uuid "fa2b4ae3-122c-51e7-9a7d-264bdf46b175" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-43308/selection/799aba6a4c6f8934e52ccc636ea5c179146568c1b0df7d84746c204ef725954a" :answer/id #uuid "c40149fa-c02a-505f-b83d-80b3be9bd219" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-43308/selection/619d89e96a97634085e0708b9c9fb875b0dce8a4185996ff1679e8689ab5b971" :answer/id #uuid "ce56bfb9-f3f6-501c-aa33-8d7aa8353783" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-43308/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "427db10e-029f-5de1-825e-9d84e67c5be4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-43308/selection/799aba6a4c6f8934e52ccc636ea5c179146568c1b0df7d84746c204ef725954a" :answer-field/choices ["q-43308/selection/75692e2af5f10c8a5a9cd964ba7987d08d791913525c7c2f6c47e226c666ec46" "q-43308/selection/600a97bfe5c0f5f450e278dad500ed1bd1542ae6fbac5348b9d39cec0165c3d5" "q-43308/selection/45ba5db4c4017ee3a1bce229a169f875d8313fcbc76b4d72f60083f66b0ba711" "q-43308/selection/799aba6a4c6f8934e52ccc636ea5c179146568c1b0df7d84746c204ef725954a" "q-43308/selection/619d89e96a97634085e0708b9c9fb875b0dce8a4185996ff1679e8689ab5b971"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-43308" :question/id #uuid "ddc6f5d8-fb4c-500a-bd59-94e92ff60083" :question/math-academy-id "q-43308" :question/problem "Which of the following is equivalent to $(1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta )(1+\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta )?$" :question/worked-solution "First, use the identity $\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }:$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta )(1+\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta ) & =(1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta )(1+\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }) \\\\  & =(1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta )(\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta +1}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }) \\\\  & =\\frac{(1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta )(1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta )}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we expand the parentheses in the numerator:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{(1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta )(1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta )}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta } & =\\frac{1-{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we rewrite the numerator using $1-{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta ={cos}^{2}⁡\\theta $ and simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1-{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta } & =\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\cdot \\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta .\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-43308/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e85a2d68-d49f-5bf4-ab62-13ad8c35b0d4"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-43308"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-65214/selection/33f84dac408867e4a6524943ad44443f79437696496e99d4e90c21f9132ec5e2" :answer/id #uuid "7b326edb-69dc-530c-9aa1-ae1b279e998e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65214/selection/211749c4aff47af3804d56c45342a226e2fb0b7defde833273b0c18967b4389a" :answer/id #uuid "841efcf5-dd10-5a94-961c-ebd1dc002998" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65214/selection/456a8960813a42aad551cc7d4c376cb554f3f910b3079920a0133e01dcbeefd0" :answer/id #uuid "a79e7dfc-d8fe-5def-8dfa-c7ab7297c4c0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{sin}^{2}⁡x+1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65214/selection/7d920e389672c4d472f44fae89e979f42917a5f0bacea2b8b1eb07f23089e5e4" :answer/id #uuid "74d1f915-7e7f-5f9e-9ebc-246f8ccc2f96" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{sin}^{2}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65214/selection/aec903952ab7a1aa6a6a87392036510631fb67237e61586043dc0a496a15b1a4" :answer/id #uuid "33d7877c-1cd3-5cb3-894a-d3494f3d705a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65214/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "83295e15-9128-5213-905a-07ce55323f89" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-65214/selection/7d920e389672c4d472f44fae89e979f42917a5f0bacea2b8b1eb07f23089e5e4" :answer-field/choices ["q-65214/selection/33f84dac408867e4a6524943ad44443f79437696496e99d4e90c21f9132ec5e2" "q-65214/selection/211749c4aff47af3804d56c45342a226e2fb0b7defde833273b0c18967b4389a" "q-65214/selection/456a8960813a42aad551cc7d4c376cb554f3f910b3079920a0133e01dcbeefd0" "q-65214/selection/7d920e389672c4d472f44fae89e979f42917a5f0bacea2b8b1eb07f23089e5e4" "q-65214/selection/aec903952ab7a1aa6a6a87392036510631fb67237e61586043dc0a496a15b1a4"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-65214" :question/id #uuid "2d1f2124-6f1c-59f5-b870-4e115144aab3" :question/math-academy-id "q-65214" :question/problem "Simplify the expression ${cos}^{3}⁡x({sec}^{3}⁡x-\\operatorname{sec}⁡x)$" :question/worked-solution "First, we expand the parentheses:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{cos}^{3}⁡x({sec}^{3}⁡x-\\operatorname{sec}⁡x) & ={cos}^{3}⁡x\\cdot {sec}^{3}⁡x-{cos}^{3}⁡x\\cdot \\operatorname{sec}⁡x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we use the identity $\\operatorname{sec}⁡x=\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}$ to further simplify the expression:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{cos}^{3}⁡x\\cdot {sec}^{3}⁡x-{cos}^{3}⁡x\\cdot \\operatorname{sec}⁡x & ={cos}^{3}⁡x\\cdot {(\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x})}^{3}-{cos}^{3}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x} \\\\  & ={cos}^{3}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{1}{{cos}^{3}⁡x}-{cos}^{3}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x} \\\\  & =\\frac{{cos}^{3}⁡x}{{cos}^{3}⁡x}-\\frac{{cos}^{3}⁡x}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\cancel{{cos}^{3}⁡x}}{\\cancel{{cos}^{3}⁡x}}-\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡x\\cdot \\cancel{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}}{\\cancel{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}} \\\\  & =1-{cos}^{2}⁡x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can use the identity ${sin}^{2}⁡x=1-{cos}^{2}⁡x$ to rewrite the expression on the right-hand side.\n\nTherefore, we conclude that:\n\n$$\n{cos}^{3}⁡x({sec}^{3}⁡x-\\operatorname{sec}⁡x)={sin}^{2}⁡x\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-65214/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e85a2d68-d49f-5bf4-ab62-13ad8c35b0d4"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-65214"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-65218/selection/211749c4aff47af3804d56c45342a226e2fb0b7defde833273b0c18967b4389a" :answer/id #uuid "d95dae00-27de-5c95-9fec-bfbafe215a15" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65218/selection/155b54824a98041c82620083a9f1e5bc0ed8bcf37d41769ee8c4bdbf4a819fd6" :answer/id #uuid "ff95ad59-63ce-5e05-b0a8-7f603854e5c1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\operatorname{csc}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65218/selection/4c9f3ef8615b0b55ee76219de1c5619f537b86448b889ea663474ab3820485f6" :answer/id #uuid "c992500d-bd8f-5679-afeb-f5d1e9bf5d24" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{sin}^{2}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65218/selection/dcf9cee52725c7f793308aadb756d75515e59cea4dfb5ab2fa0782189711e723" :answer/id #uuid "b8e01f90-5b6f-5896-afce-ebcee0ea0608" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65218/selection/cfc8fef17e139caa5fddf2aa821cf0d765f6ef916d009a28f07f272343f7f48b" :answer/id #uuid "d8260caf-4108-590b-96b5-3e7000e5b6f3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{csc}^{2}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65218/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "f57743d2-0b54-52f0-97aa-0baf676e5c8a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-65218/selection/4c9f3ef8615b0b55ee76219de1c5619f537b86448b889ea663474ab3820485f6" :answer-field/choices ["q-65218/selection/211749c4aff47af3804d56c45342a226e2fb0b7defde833273b0c18967b4389a" "q-65218/selection/155b54824a98041c82620083a9f1e5bc0ed8bcf37d41769ee8c4bdbf4a819fd6" "q-65218/selection/4c9f3ef8615b0b55ee76219de1c5619f537b86448b889ea663474ab3820485f6" "q-65218/selection/dcf9cee52725c7f793308aadb756d75515e59cea4dfb5ab2fa0782189711e723" "q-65218/selection/cfc8fef17e139caa5fddf2aa821cf0d765f6ef916d009a28f07f272343f7f48b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-65218" :question/id #uuid "66743ae6-b31c-55d6-9268-a2cebb4aa9a3" :question/math-academy-id "q-65218" :question/problem "$2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x(\\operatorname{csc}⁡x-\\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\cdot {cos}^{2}⁡x)=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we expand the parentheses:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x(\\operatorname{csc}⁡x-\\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\cdot {cos}^{2}⁡x)=2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\cdot \\operatorname{csc}⁡x-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\cdot \\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\cdot {cos}^{2}⁡x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we use the identity $\\operatorname{csc}⁡x=\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}$ to further simplify the expression:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\cdot \\operatorname{csc}⁡x-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\cdot \\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\cdot {cos}^{2}⁡x & =2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}\\cdot {cos}^{2}⁡x \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}-\\frac{2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\cdot {cos}^{2}⁡x}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x} \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\cancel{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}}{\\cancel{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}}-\\frac{2\\cancel{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}\\cdot {cos}^{2}⁡x}{\\cancel{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}} \\\\  & =2-2{cos}^{2}⁡x \\\\  & =2(1-{cos}^{2}⁡x)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can use the identity ${sin}^{2}⁡x=1-{cos}^{2}⁡x$ to rewrite the expression on the right-hand side.\n\nTherefore, we conclude that:\n\n$$\n2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x(\\operatorname{csc}⁡x-\\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\cdot {cos}^{2}⁡x)=2{sin}^{2}⁡x\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-65218/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e85a2d68-d49f-5bf4-ab62-13ad8c35b0d4"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-65218"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-65217/selection/9294c600e063101fd760df3c6f98cd7cb52cf9709f1af7170b457a478d8af8ad" :answer/id #uuid "d07ac6e6-a679-599e-b36a-5d3d282ef511" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3{cos}^{2}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65217/selection/dcf090479556f16eb18bea199e5d9a665e1b91c4d6da60f149347efedff28763" :answer/id #uuid "43335aab-0925-5a29-956f-03d64579b577" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3{sec}^{2}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65217/selection/54661d432eed36afb6f5a8d712e4546a08ef08094e547d421ed7e6f15b72dad8" :answer/id #uuid "c7f302f0-402e-5b95-b6a4-59796fab9817" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65217/selection/9f5d6ebc37e3e9c474831c3dab83213664bb8cf4a3a0293e6f1120f4e65ce5bb" :answer/id #uuid "1bc26938-7921-5223-8dd2-9580884b10b6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1+\\operatorname{cos}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65217/selection/b7fdaf33fd229ed17a44daf32563dd3d85d3417a297cac19bd7a8d6c05e4aee1" :answer/id #uuid "0bbc5f76-0e3c-5408-b66a-62faf6f77a99" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3\\operatorname{sec}⁡x+1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65217/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "9d7a1587-a9df-577a-b68d-a378523028b1" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-65217/selection/9294c600e063101fd760df3c6f98cd7cb52cf9709f1af7170b457a478d8af8ad" :answer-field/choices ["q-65217/selection/9294c600e063101fd760df3c6f98cd7cb52cf9709f1af7170b457a478d8af8ad" "q-65217/selection/dcf090479556f16eb18bea199e5d9a665e1b91c4d6da60f149347efedff28763" "q-65217/selection/54661d432eed36afb6f5a8d712e4546a08ef08094e547d421ed7e6f15b72dad8" "q-65217/selection/9f5d6ebc37e3e9c474831c3dab83213664bb8cf4a3a0293e6f1120f4e65ce5bb" "q-65217/selection/b7fdaf33fd229ed17a44daf32563dd3d85d3417a297cac19bd7a8d6c05e4aee1"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-65217" :question/id #uuid "198a6260-e6dd-5da2-9075-56d5a2f5a677" :question/math-academy-id "q-65217" :question/problem "$3\\operatorname{csc}⁡x(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-{sin}^{3}⁡x)=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we expand the parentheses:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3\\operatorname{csc}⁡x(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-{sin}^{3}⁡x)=3\\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡x-3\\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\cdot {sin}^{3}⁡x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we use the identity $\\operatorname{csc}⁡x=\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}$ to further simplify the expression:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3\\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡x-3\\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\cdot {sin}^{3}⁡x & =3\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡x-3\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}\\cdot {sin}^{3}⁡x \\\\  & =\\frac{3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}-\\frac{3{sin}^{3}⁡x}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x} \\\\  & =\\frac{3\\cancel{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}}{\\cancel{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}}-\\frac{3{sin}^{2}⁡x\\cdot \\cancel{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}}{\\cancel{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}} \\\\  & =3-3{sin}^{2}⁡x \\\\  & =3(1-{sin}^{2}⁡x)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can use the identity ${cos}^{2}⁡x=1-{sin}^{2}⁡x$  to rewrite the expression on the right-hand side.\n\nTherefore, we conclude that:\n\n$$\n3\\operatorname{csc}⁡x(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-{sin}^{3}⁡x)=3{cos}^{2}⁡x\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-65217/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e85a2d68-d49f-5bf4-ab62-13ad8c35b0d4"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-65217"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-65211/selection/aec903952ab7a1aa6a6a87392036510631fb67237e61586043dc0a496a15b1a4" :answer/id #uuid "f1a657db-49bc-5af5-a980-ed596b717204" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65211/selection/211749c4aff47af3804d56c45342a226e2fb0b7defde833273b0c18967b4389a" :answer/id #uuid "82a8fcc8-196c-5cf1-9a16-882f30365fee" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65211/selection/75745e9f978067f57d69f4a163ca3ee4e1ef4c409c29db3c558660696da4de30" :answer/id #uuid "26799556-3330-5e27-a5a3-1331b7d712c0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-{csc}^{2}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65211/selection/7d920e389672c4d472f44fae89e979f42917a5f0bacea2b8b1eb07f23089e5e4" :answer/id #uuid "3bbdae94-6e08-5e31-bbb0-d9a492749fbf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{sin}^{2}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65211/selection/b7715aaff8d8bfc13b9ad1aa1a06964070ac58e98c196e013ecabbefdbeb38c5" :answer/id #uuid "ecbbb73b-bcac-55d0-804e-cb4bc71b4712" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1-\\operatorname{csc}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65211/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "9fd41a37-2bf5-55bf-95ad-8d68d60e4407" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-65211/selection/7d920e389672c4d472f44fae89e979f42917a5f0bacea2b8b1eb07f23089e5e4" :answer-field/choices ["q-65211/selection/aec903952ab7a1aa6a6a87392036510631fb67237e61586043dc0a496a15b1a4" "q-65211/selection/211749c4aff47af3804d56c45342a226e2fb0b7defde833273b0c18967b4389a" "q-65211/selection/75745e9f978067f57d69f4a163ca3ee4e1ef4c409c29db3c558660696da4de30" "q-65211/selection/7d920e389672c4d472f44fae89e979f42917a5f0bacea2b8b1eb07f23089e5e4" "q-65211/selection/b7715aaff8d8bfc13b9ad1aa1a06964070ac58e98c196e013ecabbefdbeb38c5"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-65211" :question/id #uuid "e3ef0d2b-1955-501d-b9e1-d5aa56bd2220" :question/math-academy-id "q-65211" :question/problem "Simplify the expression $\\operatorname{cos}⁡x(\\operatorname{sec}⁡x-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)$" :question/worked-solution "First, we expand the parentheses:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x(\\operatorname{sec}⁡x-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)=\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\cdot \\operatorname{sec}⁡x-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we use the identity $\\operatorname{sec}⁡x=\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}$ to further simplify the expression:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\cdot \\operatorname{sec}⁡x-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡x & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}-{cos}^{2}⁡x \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}-{cos}^{2}⁡x \\\\  & =\\frac{\\cancel{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}}{\\cancel{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}}-{cos}^{2}⁡x \\\\  & =1-{cos}^{2}⁡x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can use the identity ${sin}^{2}⁡x=1-{cos}^{2}⁡x$ to rewrite the expression on the right-hand side.\n\nTherefore, we conclude that:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡x(\\operatorname{sec}⁡x-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)={sin}^{2}⁡x\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-65211/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e85a2d68-d49f-5bf4-ab62-13ad8c35b0d4"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-65211"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-23526/selection/0ecd8130b3138cc0d0b6f7dcff937e8b23344457055155bb5dd25cda061cdc23" :answer/id #uuid "8523c015-4a03-5945-9b2b-ea28913ce7a3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-23526/selection/a36af8358bdd9cafbeac68240f4744cb2d51f6422834cf540c90faaeea9679ee" :answer/id #uuid "97a359f3-9857-5386-839f-00bf419d76d6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta +\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-23526/selection/21ebf210dd14508d00b26881ba35644aeff73d34f4ef3f680cdff123b1fe2a55" :answer/id #uuid "9782a73d-6468-5dae-b324-07d8baac92d1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-23526/selection/4c03f75b88c123191774ec04e4d03fde194c107aa5ce616ca4e2dd0982a93702" :answer/id #uuid "23b11503-db90-5c2c-932e-630ce828ac49" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-23526/selection/184dec7ce2328a725848a5f84f70794248875e3bb8c892e88c59a57832a11672" :answer/id #uuid "8a93beb2-cc46-5ede-930f-d011353b6f55" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-23526/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "712f941d-2256-5287-82a0-7372e40f7c34" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-23526/selection/21ebf210dd14508d00b26881ba35644aeff73d34f4ef3f680cdff123b1fe2a55" :answer-field/choices ["q-23526/selection/0ecd8130b3138cc0d0b6f7dcff937e8b23344457055155bb5dd25cda061cdc23" "q-23526/selection/a36af8358bdd9cafbeac68240f4744cb2d51f6422834cf540c90faaeea9679ee" "q-23526/selection/21ebf210dd14508d00b26881ba35644aeff73d34f4ef3f680cdff123b1fe2a55" "q-23526/selection/4c03f75b88c123191774ec04e4d03fde194c107aa5ce616ca4e2dd0982a93702" "q-23526/selection/184dec7ce2328a725848a5f84f70794248875e3bb8c892e88c59a57832a11672"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-23526" :question/id #uuid "d58ed21c-2695-53ea-85df-0c7a82fbe9a0" :question/math-academy-id "q-23526" :question/problem "$\\frac{1-2{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }+\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }=$" :question/worked-solution "Since both fractions are over a common denominator, we can add them. This gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1-2{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }+\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta } & =\\frac{1-2{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta +{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\frac{1-{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we use ${cos}^{2}⁡\\theta =1-{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta $ to simplify the expression in the numerator:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1-{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta } & =\\frac{{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta .\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\frac{1-2{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }+\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }=\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta .\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-23526/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "23637774-8d69-500d-8cb0-5e41a0207542"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-23526"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-1584/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "b7174108-255f-5102-bf20-d44a1f3c9894" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-1584/selection/681a4b64a7bb464b7f554c4e26477e3547d3c60cd353fce5dda4ae108b1c4fa5" :answer/id #uuid "5fdb5ea8-a48e-5560-881c-71cb67cdf3d6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-1584/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "0bc3e2cd-d241-5431-abcc-228e3997edc6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-1584/selection/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" :answer/id #uuid "a3fd94af-3e25-5afd-9a3f-2261b108cd6c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-1584/selection/4e2cb386499e1926f074a7bcd422a63175a237204a3823f0fa6c86b56d301873" :answer/id #uuid "c46f0f01-bd4f-518d-831d-19504cbf049a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-1584/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "b12e7b03-e883-5d78-9a0f-d985a3b8a522" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-1584/selection/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" :answer-field/choices ["q-1584/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" "q-1584/selection/681a4b64a7bb464b7f554c4e26477e3547d3c60cd353fce5dda4ae108b1c4fa5" "q-1584/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" "q-1584/selection/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" "q-1584/selection/4e2cb386499e1926f074a7bcd422a63175a237204a3823f0fa6c86b56d301873"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-1584" :question/id #uuid "c9911307-0112-59e4-9738-ff3a7034ff3f" :question/math-academy-id "q-1584" :question/problem "$\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡t-1}{{cos}^{2}⁡t{tan}^{2}⁡t}=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we rewrite the numerator using $1-{cos}^{2}⁡t={sin}^{2}⁡t:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡t-1}{{cos}^{2}⁡t{tan}^{2}⁡t} & =\\frac{-1\\cdot (1-{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta )}{{cos}^{2}⁡t{tan}^{2}⁡t} \\\\  & =\\frac{-{sin}^{2}⁡t}{{cos}^{2}⁡t\\cdot {tan}^{2}⁡t}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we rewrite the denominator using the definition of $\\operatorname{tan}⁡\\theta $ and simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{-{sin}^{2}⁡t}{{cos}^{2}⁡t\\cdot {tan}^{2}⁡t} & =\\frac{-{sin}^{2}⁡t}{{cos}^{2}⁡t\\cdot {(\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡t}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡t})}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-{sin}^{2}⁡t}{{cos}^{2}⁡t\\cdot (\\frac{{sin}^{2}⁡t}{{cos}^{2}⁡t})} \\\\  & =\\frac{-{sin}^{2}⁡t}{(\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡t\\cdot {sin}^{2}⁡t}{{cos}^{2}⁡t})} \\\\  & =\\frac{-{sin}^{2}⁡t}{(\\frac{\\cancel{{cos}^{2}⁡t}\\cdot {sin}^{2}⁡t}{\\cancel{{cos}^{2}⁡t}})} \\\\  & =\\frac{-{sin}^{2}⁡t}{{sin}^{2}⁡t} \\\\  & =\\frac{-\\cancel{{sin}^{2}⁡t}}{\\cancel{{sin}^{2}⁡t}} \\\\  & =-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that:\n\n$$\n\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡t-1}{{cos}^{2}⁡t{tan}^{2}⁡t}=-1\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-1584/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "23637774-8d69-500d-8cb0-5e41a0207542"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-1584"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-1583/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "fe5e7e9b-bc8f-5775-9485-47af8375b211" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-1583/selection/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" :answer/id #uuid "27bb5c10-5f4f-521f-b09d-12b0cc4ce9fd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-1583/selection/4e2cb386499e1926f074a7bcd422a63175a237204a3823f0fa6c86b56d301873" :answer/id #uuid "3de64ba8-4a91-5aa2-a18a-fd4efc1f0b6b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-1583/selection/f80535409f78d0e1b5cd0ceb7e72783093e3cde8adf28a5032c83c6dc6b5e490" :answer/id #uuid "89351033-f1b7-5db0-91f1-b329f9030bfb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-1583/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "ddcb8b3b-f528-54f0-bc07-fdef2ba0da80" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-1583/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "d83573d3-58b0-50f3-a5d4-26d2ca1d1119" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-1583/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer-field/choices ["q-1583/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" "q-1583/selection/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" "q-1583/selection/4e2cb386499e1926f074a7bcd422a63175a237204a3823f0fa6c86b56d301873" "q-1583/selection/f80535409f78d0e1b5cd0ceb7e72783093e3cde8adf28a5032c83c6dc6b5e490" "q-1583/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-1583" :question/id #uuid "1b9f7423-53ea-52bd-a634-039b96bcb018" :question/math-academy-id "q-1583" :question/problem "$\\frac{1}{{cos}^{2}⁡A}-\\frac{1}{{cot}^{2}⁡A}=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we use the definition of $\\operatorname{cot}⁡A$ to rewrite the second term:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{{cos}^{2}⁡A}-\\frac{1}{{cot}^{2}⁡A} & =\\frac{1}{{cos}^{2}⁡A}-{tan}^{2}⁡A \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{{cos}^{2}⁡A}-\\frac{{sin}^{2}⁡A}{{cos}^{2}⁡A} \\\\  & =\\frac{1-{sin}^{2}⁡A}{{cos}^{2}⁡A}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can use the identity $1-{sin}^{2}⁡A={cos}^{2}⁡A$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1-{sin}^{2}⁡A}{{cos}^{2}⁡A} & =\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡A}{{cos}^{2}⁡A}=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{{cos}^{2}⁡A}-\\frac{1}{{cot}^{2}⁡A}=1\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-1583/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "23637774-8d69-500d-8cb0-5e41a0207542"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-1583"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-24322/selection/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff" :answer/id #uuid "572b3dc9-c4fe-546b-a5c0-c7b6ce855642" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-24322/selection/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" :answer/id #uuid "2e1ce960-9e6c-5d4e-88c2-4237a9359f6f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-24322/selection/5ab3573096b30d3c5d3c378e667364cbb062f921e9b1002441e594f0774a669d" :answer/id #uuid "2a64978c-5658-51d7-8e26-54f304d0b377" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-24322/selection/d027d90726f5bdbf1525aade1b6bde5c85e2082f2b792dfacee399fcc90e9833" :answer/id #uuid "34321c77-8813-5672-ad01-3ad1d91d4f01" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-24322/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "e0b253af-291a-55f0-983c-1cff1fd09e4b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-24322/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "0a0e142c-6ab2-5b2c-8fe6-38b00083b9e5" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-24322/selection/d027d90726f5bdbf1525aade1b6bde5c85e2082f2b792dfacee399fcc90e9833" :answer-field/choices ["q-24322/selection/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff" "q-24322/selection/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" "q-24322/selection/5ab3573096b30d3c5d3c378e667364cbb062f921e9b1002441e594f0774a669d" "q-24322/selection/d027d90726f5bdbf1525aade1b6bde5c85e2082f2b792dfacee399fcc90e9833" "q-24322/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-24322" :question/id #uuid "5e2ba7e3-c56a-5de4-af53-4b9170dfe278" :question/math-academy-id "q-24322" :question/problem "$\\frac{\\operatorname{sec}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }{3\\operatorname{tan}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we rewrite the expression using the definitions of $\\operatorname{sec}⁡\\theta $ and $\\operatorname{tan}⁡\\theta $:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\operatorname{sec}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }{3\\operatorname{tan}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta } & =\\frac{\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }-\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }{3(\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta })\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we multiply the numerator and the denominator by $\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta $ and simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\cdot (\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }-\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta )}{3\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\cdot (\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta })\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta } & =\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\cdot \\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }-{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }{3(\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\cdot {sin}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta })} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\cancel{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\cancel{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }}-{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }{3(\\frac{\\cancel{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }\\cdot {sin}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\cancel{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }})} \\\\  & =\\frac{1-{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }{3{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta }\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we use $1-{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta ={sin}^{2}⁡\\theta $ to simplify the expression:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1-{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }{3{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta } & =\\frac{{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta }{3{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\frac{\\cancel{{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta }}{3\\cancel{{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta }} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that:\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\operatorname{sec}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }{3\\operatorname{tan}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }=\\frac{1}{3}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-24322/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "23637774-8d69-500d-8cb0-5e41a0207542"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-24322"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-65236/selection/53c9cc53c9151a84ee0fa4eb42f3c6e72ec949096bdc0a8e9511a23936508243" :answer/id #uuid "1e6c1dfd-9305-5a49-a291-2772deb3341a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65236/selection/45ba5db4c4017ee3a1bce229a169f875d8313fcbc76b4d72f60083f66b0ba711" :answer/id #uuid "48792636-2a45-50ef-a579-519d41f378ad" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65236/selection/6e44b1d00c6e011da7c2a21f6e8fd9583586f22675d9c105fa8e99675a13bea9" :answer/id #uuid "07986fd4-6339-581c-99e1-5275a93d0365" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{sec}^{2}⁡\\theta " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65236/selection/619d89e96a97634085e0708b9c9fb875b0dce8a4185996ff1679e8689ab5b971" :answer/id #uuid "23f7184f-153f-55df-8322-edaf4a1e78af" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65236/selection/0e12f908604aabb2d8221c3da3bd6ad1a1bd3ffa2437d35681391b8808a68398" :answer/id #uuid "4bc6c437-5138-5aeb-b5c1-9e4c7f863a7e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{sec}⁡\\theta " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65236/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "f31fe44b-f2b3-5f66-acb6-0a9dfc213e0f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-65236/selection/619d89e96a97634085e0708b9c9fb875b0dce8a4185996ff1679e8689ab5b971" :answer-field/choices ["q-65236/selection/53c9cc53c9151a84ee0fa4eb42f3c6e72ec949096bdc0a8e9511a23936508243" "q-65236/selection/45ba5db4c4017ee3a1bce229a169f875d8313fcbc76b4d72f60083f66b0ba711" "q-65236/selection/6e44b1d00c6e011da7c2a21f6e8fd9583586f22675d9c105fa8e99675a13bea9" "q-65236/selection/619d89e96a97634085e0708b9c9fb875b0dce8a4185996ff1679e8689ab5b971" "q-65236/selection/0e12f908604aabb2d8221c3da3bd6ad1a1bd3ffa2437d35681391b8808a68398"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-65236" :question/id #uuid "bb8fff87-14e7-5173-a0e7-aa3da38b9006" :question/math-academy-id "q-65236" :question/problem "$\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }-\\frac{{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we factor the expression:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }-\\frac{{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta } & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }-\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }\\cdot {sin}^{2}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }(1-{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta )\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we use ${cos}^{2}⁡\\theta =1-{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta $ to simplify the expression in the parentheses:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }(1-{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta ) & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }\\cdot {cos}^{2}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\frac{\\cancel{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }{\\cancel{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, we conclude that:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }-\\frac{{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }=\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-65236/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "23637774-8d69-500d-8cb0-5e41a0207542"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-65236"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-119864/selection/33f84dac408867e4a6524943ad44443f79437696496e99d4e90c21f9132ec5e2" :answer/id #uuid "b7f976e9-845d-585c-a30a-d5db1ba6d2bb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-119864/selection/97eb32960e10ed56e7566c7a0b4ceb22280c14a8f31be59b176c86d154befd08" :answer/id #uuid "8a6b5628-8739-524c-8d86-9066732bff0a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-(1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-119864/selection/211749c4aff47af3804d56c45342a226e2fb0b7defde833273b0c18967b4389a" :answer/id #uuid "caffff83-e7da-5a66-a046-2750216af54a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-119864/selection/aec903952ab7a1aa6a6a87392036510631fb67237e61586043dc0a496a15b1a4" :answer/id #uuid "5fdfdfd9-9b44-58f7-9ad6-64002e5c9515" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-119864/selection/56247185880420565171369da7cf460bfa7d363ceeed838a1573ecf9ca68415a" :answer/id #uuid "3e51a5b7-8e4f-5e1e-be08-a80125fdebc9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-119864/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "4642b8ad-4d35-59d8-843c-930abe290c27" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-119864/selection/97eb32960e10ed56e7566c7a0b4ceb22280c14a8f31be59b176c86d154befd08" :answer-field/choices ["q-119864/selection/33f84dac408867e4a6524943ad44443f79437696496e99d4e90c21f9132ec5e2" "q-119864/selection/97eb32960e10ed56e7566c7a0b4ceb22280c14a8f31be59b176c86d154befd08" "q-119864/selection/211749c4aff47af3804d56c45342a226e2fb0b7defde833273b0c18967b4389a" "q-119864/selection/aec903952ab7a1aa6a6a87392036510631fb67237e61586043dc0a496a15b1a4" "q-119864/selection/56247185880420565171369da7cf460bfa7d363ceeed838a1573ecf9ca68415a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-119864" :question/id #uuid "0a411090-86b1-5b85-b794-25064aecdcb0" :question/math-academy-id "q-119864" :question/problem "Simplify the expression $\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡x}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-1}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we rewrite the numerator using $1-{sin}^{2}⁡x={cos}^{2}⁡x.$\n\n$$\n\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡x}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-1}=\\frac{1-{sin}^{2}⁡x}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-1}\n$$\n\nNext, we factor the numerator as a difference of squares, and simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1-{sin}^{2}⁡x}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-1} & =\\frac{(1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)(1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-1} \\\\  & =-\\frac{(1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)(1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)}{1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x} \\\\  & =-\\frac{(1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)\\cancel{(1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)}}{\\cancel{1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{1} \\\\  & =-(1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡x}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-1}=-(1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x).\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-119864/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "b05f4be1-95d4-5137-bbaa-71c95862bb59"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-119864"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-119869/selection/a81159dce1581eefcd6c166e1aba2691c1b61c8a93fc8f4f4a58a9f7e7027f9a" :answer/id #uuid "aa8179a5-6692-5698-b59a-14371af4b5f7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2+\\operatorname{cos}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-119869/selection/d592242f5907